<h2 class="doc-h2">Presets</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    Links, so each preset is a URL: "last 30 days" can be sent to a colleague and reached by the
    back button, which a click handler that mutates state cannot offer.
</p>
<Example Source="CalendarPresets.razor"><CalendarPresets /></Example>

